# Detection marker only -- this file is deliberately NOT a class list.
#
# Vector's manager treats the presence of this entry as proof that the package
# is a module, which is the whole reason it ships: it gets the module into the
# manager's list even on a device where the legacy xposedminversion meta-data
# does not reach ApplicationInfo.metaData.
#
# It is never read on this APK, because module.prop declares no targetApiVersion
# and therefore FileSystem.loadModule selects the LEGACY strategy and reads
# assets/xposed_init instead. The class list below would only come into play if
# something forced the MODERN path, and a legacy de.robv.android.xposed module
# has no libxposed entry class to name.
